      "blocks": {
        "faq_question_8JwDzC": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>It's for anyone experiencing feelings of panic, stress, anxiety, restlessness, irritability, or difficulty focusing</p>",
            "title": "Who is it for?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_UnWAet": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Benefits include reducing stress and anxiety, improving mood and focus, reducing cortisol levels without sleepiness or brain fog.</p>",
            "title": "What are the benefits?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_XEUxDm": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Yes, Calm is formulated to reduce feelings of panic and nervousness, providing an instant feeling of zen.</p>",
            "title": "Can Calm help with panic attacks?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_cRxrPB": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Yes, Calm is dependency-free and safe for everyday use.</p><p>Take 2 Calm Alchemy Capsules daily or whenever you need rapid relief from stress and anxiety</p><p>Keep taking daily for long term relief</p>",
            "title": "Can I take Calm daily?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_dxbtWR": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Arrae Calm is a holistic supplement designed to alleviate stress and anxiety in under an hour using four natural ingredients</p>",
            "title": "What is Arrae Calm?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_hq8jbX": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Calm works by relaxing muscles, releasing tension, increasing calming neurotransmitters in the brain, and slowing down spiraling thoughts.</p>",
            "title": "How does Calm work?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_pgefYt": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Arrae Calm is made with all-natural ingredients and is clinically studied to have no side effects like drowsiness or dependency</p>",
            "title": "Are there any side effects?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_wFpAdL": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>While Calm offers a natural alternative to manage symptoms of anxiety and stress, it’s important to consult with a healthcare professional.</p>",
            "title": "Can Calm replace my current anxiety or depression medication?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_y3ekpF": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Calm stands out with its clinically proven efficacy, fast-acting relief, no side effects or dependencies, and its blend of specifically chosen, all-natural ingredients.</p>",
            "title": "How is Calm different from other anxiety relief supplements?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        }
